 "3": {
  "text": "ACI is organized into three technical domains, chromatography and mass spectrometry, X-ray spectroscopy and microscopy, and NMR, physical and thermal cheracterization. Together, our domain leads and staff manage a broad range of shared scientific resources and provide analytical and characterization support, as well as technical training, to our research community. Beyond supporting our internal ERD activities, we also extend our capabilities to industry partners, providing services such as material cheracterization, failure diagnostics, method development, consultancy, and collaboration. Through these capabilities, we aim to provide practical analytical solutions to support different research and industry needs.",
