 "4": {
  "text": "The CI division is led by our division director, Andrew Lim, and Aung Li Li as the Division Deputy Director. And it comprises three technical domains, each led by our respective domain lead. The Chromatography and Mass Spectrometry domain is led by Mr. Aung Wei Chung, supported by our instrument specialists, Eng Fu Song and Tan Kwan Yi. The X-ray Spectroscopy and Microscopy domain is led by Ms. Angel Lin, together with three senior domain specialists, Wanzan, Chia Shichen, and Chao Shin, who specialize in XPS, XRD and TEM respectively. Aung Li Li also served as the domain lead of NMR, Physical and Thermal Cheracterization, supported by instrument specialists Yo Wenchang and Kwan Kaichong. Beyond our analytical and characterization work, AC also plays an important role in managing shared scientific resources across the Institute. Our responsibilities include equipment booking, utilization and charging, demand aggregation, scientific equipment and systems refresh, and equipment lefesical management. We also support digitalization and sustainability initiatives. Together, these activities help ensure that our scientific resources are effectively managed, optimized, and kept relevant to support the evolving research needs across the Institute.",
